<LegalLayout title="Accessibility Statement" intro="New Beginnings is committed to providing an accessible website for people of all abilities."><h2>Our commitment</h2><p>We aim to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines, including semantic structure, keyboard access, visible focus indicators, readable contrast, alternative text, and support for reduced motion.</p><h2>Need assistance?</h2><p>If you have difficulty using this website or need information in another format, call 412-628-0403. Please describe the page or feature involved and the type of assistance you need.</p><h2>Ongoing improvement</h2><p>Accessibility is an ongoing responsibility. We review the website as content and technology change and welcome specific feedback that helps us improve access.</p></LegalLayout>
